    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sanduuqii Axdiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Besaleel wuxuu sanduuqii ka sameeyey qori qudhac ah, oo dhererkiisuna wuxuu ahaa laba dhudhun iyo badh, ballaadhkiisuna wuxuu ahaa dhudhun iyo badh, sarajooggiisuna wuxuu ahaa dhudhun iyo badh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu gudaha iyo dibaddaba kaga dahaadhay dahab saafi ah, oo wuxuu u yeelay wax taaj oo kale ah oo dahab ah oo ku wareegsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasuu wuxuu u yeelay afar siddo oo dahab ah oo afartiisa rukun ee hoose ku yaal; oo laba siddoba dhinac buu kaga dhejiyey, dhinaca kalena laba siddo buu kaga dhejiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuxuuna ulo ka sameeyey qori qudhac ah, dahab buuna ku dahaadhay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu ulihii wuxuu geliyey siddooyinkii sanduuqa dhinacyadiisa ku yiil, si sanduuqa loogu qaado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu wuxuu dahab saafi ah ka sameeyey dabool, oo dhererkiisuna wuxuu ahaa laba dhudhun iyo badh, ballaadhkiisuna wuxuu ahaa dhudhun iyo badh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu laba keruub ka sameeyey dahab la tumay, oo daboolkii labadiisa madax ayuu ka taagay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keruub wuxuu ka sameeyey madax, keruubkii kalena wuxuu ka sameeyey madaxa kale; oo labada keruub oo labada madax ka kala taagan iyo daboolkii wuxuu ka wada sameeyey isku waslad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo keruubiimtuna meel sare ayay baalashooda ka soo kala bixiyeen, oo daboolkay baalashooda ku qariyeen, wejiyadooduna way iska soo hor jeedeen; oo keruubiimta wejiyadoodu waxay ku soo jeedeen daboolka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miiska",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miiskana qori qudhac ah ayuu ka sameeyey, oo dhererkiisu wuxuu ahaa laba dhudhun, ballaadhkiisuna dhudhun, sarajooggiisuna dhudhun iyo badh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo wuxuu ku dahaadhay dahab saafi ah, oo wuxuuna u yeelay wax taaj oo kale ah oo dahab ah oo ku wareegsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu u yeelay qar le'eg calaacal ballaadhkeed oo ku wareegsan, oo qarkiina wuxuu u yeelay wax taaj oo kale ah oo dahab ah oo ku wada wareegsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu u yeelay afar siddo oo dahab ah, oo wuxuu siddooyinkii ku dhejiyey afarta gees oo afarta rukun oo hoose kaga yiil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo siddooyinku waxay ku dhowaayeen qarka, iyagoo ah meelaha laga geliyo ulaha miiska lagu qaado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu ulihii ka sameeyey qori qudhac ah oo ku dahaadhay dahab, si miiska loogu qaado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu dahab saafi ah ka sameeyey alaabtii miiska saarnayd oo dhan oo ahayd suxuuntiisii, iyo malqacadihiisii, iyo maddiibadihiisii, iyo kidhliyadiisii wax laga shubo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Laambaddii Dahabka Ahayd",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu laambadda ka sameeyey dahab saafi ah, oo laambaddii waxay ahayd mid tuman, xataa salkeeda iyo usheeda dhexe iyo koobabkeeda, iyo burooyinkeeda iyo ubaxeeduba isku waslad bay la wada ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhinacyadeeda waxaa ka baxayay lix laamood, oo saddex laamood dhinac bay kaga yiilleen, saddex laamoodna dhinaca kale ayay kaga yiilleen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo saddex koob oo yicib ubaxeed u eg, iyo buro, iyo ubax baa isku laan ku yiil, laanta kalena waxaa ku yiil saddex koob oo yicib ubaxeed u eg, iyo buro, iyo ubax, oo lixdii laamood oo ka baxday laambaddii sidaasay wada ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo laambaddii waxaa ku yiil afar koob oo yicib ubaxeed u eg, iyo burooyinkoodii iyo ubaxoodii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo buro waxay ku tiil laba laamood hoostood, isku waslad bayna la ahayd, buro kalena waxay ku tiil laba laamood hoostood, isku waslad bayna la ahayd, burona waxay ku tiil laba laamood hoostood, isku waslad bayna la ahayd, oo lixda laamoodba sidaasay wada ahaayeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo burooyinkooda iyo laamahooduba isku waslad bay la ahaayeen: oo kulligeedna waxay ahayd isku waslad dahab la tumay oo saafi ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dahab saafi ah wuxuu ka sameeyey toddobadeedii laambadood, iyo birqaabyadeedii iyo alaabteedii lagu safayn jirayba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyada iyo alaabteeda oo dhanba wuxuu ka sameeyey talanti dahab saafi ah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meesha Fooxa Lagu Shido",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meeshii allabariga ee fooxana wuxuu ka sameeyey qori qudhac ah, oo dhererkeeduna wuxuu ahaa dhudhun, ballaadhkeeduna wuxuu ahaa dhudhun, oo afar geesood bay ahayd, sarajooggeeduna wuxuu ahaa laba dhudhun, oo geesaheeduna isku waslad bay la ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu dahab ku dahaadhay dusheedii iyo dhinacyadeedii ku wareegsanaa, iyo geesaheedii, oo wuxuu u sameeyey wax taaj oo kale ah oo dahab ah oo ku wareegsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qarka hoostiisa laba siddo oo dahab ah ayuu ugu yeelay labadeeda rukun inay labadeeda dhinac ugu ahaadaan meelaha ulaha lagu qaado laga gelin lahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
